### ============================================
### AUTENTICAÇÃO
### ============================================

### EP02 - Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "pass"
}

### EP03 - Alterar palavra-passe (requer autenticação)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "pass",
  "new_password": "newpass",
  "confirm_password": "newpass"
}

### ============================================
### UTILIZADORES
### ============================================

### EP01 - Criar utilizador (apenas Administrator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "pass",
  "name": "New User",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "role": "Collaborator"
}

### EP04 - Consultar perfil de utilizador
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### EP05 - Listar utilizadores (Administrator, Responsible)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar publicações de um utilizador
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/admin/publications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Histórico de atividades de um utilizador
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/admin/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Alterar role de utilizador (apenas Administrator)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/newuser/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Responsible"
}

### Ativar/Desativar utilizador (apenas Administrator)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/newuser/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": false
}

### ============================================
### PUBLICAÇÕES
### ============================================

### EP01 - Upload de publicação (PDF ou ZIP) - cria publicação diretamente
### NOTA: Para testar este endpoint, precisas de um ficheiro real.
### No IntelliJ IDEA, podes usar a funcionalidade de selecionar ficheiro.
### Ou usa Postman/Thunder Client para fazer upload de um ficheiro.
POST {{baseUrl}}/publications/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\path\to\your\file.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### NOTA: Não existe endpoint POST /publications (sem /upload)
### As publicações são criadas APENAS via upload de ficheiro (POST /publications/upload)

### Listar todas as publicações visíveis
GET {{baseUrl}}/publications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Obter publicação específica
GET {{baseUrl}}/publications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar publicação (summary, visibility)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/publications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "summary": "Resumo atualizado",
  "visibility": "hidden"
}

### Histórico de edições da publicação
GET {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar ficheiro de publicação existente
### NOTA: Substitui o caminho do ficheiro pelo caminho real do teu ficheiro
POST {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/file
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="updated.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./path/to/your/file.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### ============================================
### TAGS
### ============================================

### Criar tag (apenas Responsible/Administrator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Machine Learning"
}

### Listar todas as tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Obter tag específica
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Remover tag (apenas Responsible/Administrator)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tags/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### COMENTÁRIOS E RATINGS
### ============================================

### Criar comentário em publicação
POST {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Excelente publicação!"
}

### Listar comentários de uma publicação
GET {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Ocultar/mostrar comentário (apenas Responsible/Administrator)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/comments/1/hidden
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hidden": true
}

### Apagar comentário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/comments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar ou atualizar rating
POST {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 5
}

### Listar ratings de uma publicação
GET {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Apagar rating
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/ratings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Associar tag a publicação
POST {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/tags/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desassociar tag de publicação (apenas Responsible/Administrator)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/publications/1/tags/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### SUBSCRIÇÕES DE TAGS
### ============================================

### Listar tags subscritas por um utilizador
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/admin/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Subscrever tag
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/admin/tags/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desinscrever tag
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/admin/tags/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
